! Generated by FWShift: CLI commands for the Layer 3 policy and NAT of a Moxa industrial secure router
! (EDR-810, EDR-G902/G903, TN-4900 with the classic router firmware). Paste them into the console after
! logging in; read the report first, what is not written is listed there. Nothing is deleted or saved.
! The policies are numbered from 1 on: firewall N changes a policy that exists at N, so on a router
! with policies give --policy-id-start one above the last index that show firewall lists.
configure
firewall 1
 src-ip single 0.0.0.0
 action drop
 protocol all
 dst-ip range 10.40.0.0 10.40.0.255
 interface all all
exit
firewall 1 disable
